---
import Layout from "../layout/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Darren R. Skidmore"
  description="Privacy Policy for darrenskidmore.com."
>
  <section class="stack">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <em>Last updated 01 June 2026.</em>
    <h2 id="general">General</h2>
    <p>
      The following applies to all content on
      <code>darrenskidmore.com</code>:
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is hosted by a DigitalOcean VPS (virtual private server), with
      Cloudflare acting as a reverse proxy/DNS resolver and Nginx as the web
      server.
    </p>
    <p>The following applies to all content hosted on this site:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Nginx server logs, which include Cloudflare-proxied IP addresses,
        timestamps, paths, and user agents, are stored in the VPS for up to 14
        days. Users' real IP addresses are not stored.
      </li>
      <li>
        Cloudflare may process network and request metadata as part of
        delivering content, caching assets, and providing analytics for this
        site.
      </li>
      <li>
        Cloudflare Web Analytics is used for aggregate usage and performance
        statistics for this site, such as country and device type. Cloudflare
        Web Analytics is not used to identify individual users of this site.
      </li>
      <li>Neither cookies nor advertising services are used.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy and this site's data governance procedures do not
      apply to third-party pages linked from this site.
    </p>
    <h2 id="census-visualizer">Census Visualizer</h2>
    <p>
      The following applies specifically to the <strong
        >Census Visualizer</strong
      > website:
    </p>
    <p>
      Census Visualizer does not use cookies, local storage, or session storage.
      The page URL hash is used to keep track of the selected geography so links
      can be shared or revisited.
    </p>
    <p>While using Census Visualizer, requests may be sent to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Census Visualizer's API and web server</li>
      <li>OpenStreetMap for base map tiles</li>
      <li>
        <code>geotiles.darrenskidmore.com</code>, which serves PMTiles assets
        from Cloudflare R2
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Third-party providers such as Cloudflare, Cloudflare R2, and OpenStreetMap
      may process network and request metadata as part of delivering content,
      caching assets, and providing analytics. This may include information such
      as IP addresses, browser type, request path, and timing data.
    </p>
    <h2 id="ipip-workbench">IPIP Workbench</h2>
    <p>
      The following applies specifically to the <strong>IPIP Workbench</strong> website:
    </p>
    <p>
      IPIP Workbench uses the browser's local storage to store in-progress
      quizzes and complete results. No quiz responses are collected or stored
      server-side.
    </p>
    <h2 id="utah-home-values">Utah Home Values Explorer</h2>
    <p>
      The following applies specifically to the <strong
        >Utah Home Values Explorer</strong
      > website:
    </p>
    <p>
      Utah Home Values Explorer does not use cookies, local storage, or session
      storage. The page URL hash is used to keep track of the selected geography
      so links can be shared or revisited.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
